        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "lightning:1masbil",
          "html": "Go up the west stairs, and use the extended brush on the fireplace in the nearby room for a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Conductor_mould\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">conductor mould</a>.",
          "text": "Go up the west stairs, and use the extended brush on the fireplace in the nearby room for a conductor mould.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "lightning:1i9o6v6",
          "html": "At any furnace, make the conductor with a silver bar. In the smelting interface, look under the &#39;casting metals &amp; glass&#39; section. Under the &#39;silver casting&#39; subsection of that section, there will be an option to make a conductor.",
          "text": "At any furnace, make the conductor with a silver bar. In the smelting interface, look under the 'casting metals & glass' section. Under the 'silver casting' subsection of that section, there will be an option to make a conductor.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "lightning:1i9o6v6:1p5vd4c",
              "html": "<b>Be sure to make only one, as the furnace will try to use multiple bars.</b>",
              "text": "Be sure to make only one, as the furnace will try to use multiple bars.",
